hub.com/repos/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/deployments","created_at":"2026-04-06T11:35:30Z","updated_at":"2026-10-28T19:24:29Z","pushed_at":"2026-10-28T19:24:25Z","git_url":"git://github.com/HeaInSeo/NodeKit.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:HeaInSeo/NodeKit.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/HeaInSeo/NodeKit.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/HeaInSeo/NodeKit","homepage":null,"size":56437,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"language":"C#","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":0,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":9,"license":null,"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":9,"watchers":0,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":true,"maintain":true,"push":true,"triage":true,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/pulls/75","html_url":"https://github.com/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/pull/75","diff_url":"https://github.com/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/pull/75.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/pull/75.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-20T22:10:38Z"},"body":"## Summary\nImplements the decision recorded on #71: `submit` must not rely solely on Ctrl-C to escape a stuck `WatchToolBuild` phase. `--connect-timeout` (#65/#67) only bounds the resolve+submit phase (before a build ID exists) — `WatchToolBuild` (observing a real in-progress build) needs the opposite policy, since it legitimately runs long.\n\n**`--watch-timeout <duration>`** (e.g. `2h`, `90m`, `120s` — duration format rather than `--connect-timeout`'s bare seconds, since watch durations are typically much longer and bare-seconds integers invite mistakes at that scale):\n\n- **Opt-in, no default** — omitting it preserves prior behavior (Ctrl-C only) exactly.\n- Armed the moment a build ID is first received (exactly when `--connect-timeout` is disarmed) via its own `CancellationTokenSource`, linked into the existing `cts`/`connectTimeoutCts` chain.\n- **Does NOT cancel the server-side build on timeout** (explicit #71 decision) — the build may legitimately still be running, so `ReportWatchTimeout` does not call `CancelServerBuildBestEffort`, unlike the Ctrl-C path.\n- On firing, prints the build ID and the last-event-received timestamp so the user can check status manually, and returns a **distinct exit code (125)** from `--connect-timeout` (124) and Ctrl-C (130).\n\n## Deferred (tracked as #74)\n`--idle-timeout` (inactivity-based, resets per event instead of an absolute cap) — rejected for this issue because the current `WatchToolBuild` protocol doesn't guarantee periodic events, so an idle timeout without a heartbeat guarantee would misclassify a healthy-but-quiet build phase as stuck. Needs NodeVault-side heartbeat support first.\n\n## Tests\n- Option parsing: missing value, invalid formats (`abc`, `2x`, `0h`, `-5m`, bare `120`), valid formats (`2h`, `90m`, `120s`, `1.5h`), duplicate.\n- Fires and does NOT call `CancelBuildAsync` (fake client).\n- Does not fire if the build completes first (fake client).\n- End-to-end through the real `GrpcToolSpecClient` against an in-process fake gRPC server (`WatchToolBuild` sends one event then hangs, honoring server-side cancellation) — matching the lesson from #67 that fake-only coverage can miss real-client-specific behavior.\n\n## Validation run\n- `dotnet build`: 0 warnings, 0 errors\n- `dotnet test`: 675 total, 673 passed, 2 skipped (opt-in NodeVault integration test, expected), 0 failed\n- `dotnet format NodeKit.sln --verify-no-changes`: clean\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/issues/75/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/issues/75/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":28237500227,"node_id":"REFE_lADOR7DUgM8AAAABJg2ve88AAAAGkxYPQw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/issues/events/28237500227","actor":{"login":"HeaInSeo","id":126678443,"node_id":"U_kgDOB4z1qw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126678443?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeaInSeo","html_url":"https://github.com/HeaInSeo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeaInSeo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeaInSeo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeaInSeo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeaInSeo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeaInSeo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeaInSeo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeaInSeo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeaInSeo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"htt