91df6008fc5ace5cee44d55`.\nWriter: Operator session `032faefa-eb84-4a4a-86dc-15db7fefe22e`.\n\n### What changes\n- **Staged client seam on the shared `IToolSpecBuildClient`:** `ToolSpecBuildOptions` adds `RequestId`, a caller-provided identity, and `BeforeSubmitAsync`, a durable-store seam. The client awaits the seam after `ResolveToolSpec` and before `SubmitToolBuild`.\n  - If the store throws (anything other than a cancellation), there is no Submit and no Watch. The run ends with a `Failed` event that names the request ID.\n  - Cancellation still propagates.\n  - The request ID sent on the wire is always the stored ID.\n- **Full resolved basis:** `ToolSpecSubmitBasis` holds the requested name, version and `requested_at`, plus the server's `tool_spec_digest`, `tool_name`, `version` and `resolved_at`. It rides on the spec-resolved `BuildEvent.SubmitBasis`, so no caller has to parse the shortened log line. `JobCreated` now carries `RequestId`.\n- **Compatibility:** the existing 4-arg `ResolveAndBuildAsync` stays as an adapter: it uses default options and a fresh GUID per submit, so GUI and CLI behaviour is unchanged. The new overload has a default interface implementation for existing implementers (GUI and test fakes). It delegates only when the options are empty, and throws `NotSupportedException` otherwise, so options are never silently ignored.\n- `FakeBuildService` records each deserialized Resolve, Submit and Watch request and the RPC order.\n\n### S2-01 evidence map (`tests/NodeKit.Cli.Tests/ToolSpecWireP05Tests.cs`)\n| ID | Test(s) | Layer |\n|---|---|---|\n| C01 | `S2_01_C01_MissingSourceChecksum_ExitsOneWithZeroRpc`, `…VersionOnlyPackage_StrictReproducible_ExitsOneWithZeroRpc`, `…VersionOnlyPackage_DefaultSubmit_SendsTheRenderedPayloadUnchanged` | `SubmitCommand` + real `GrpcToolSpecClient` → in-process gRPC |\n| C02 | `S2_01_C02_ResolveRequest_CarriesRecipeIdentityAndRenderedRawSpecBytes` (raw_spec == `render --format raw-spec` bytes, exactly 7 keys in order, `requested_at` in ms), `…IsNotTheLegacyBuildRequestPreview` | generated gRPC request capture |\n| C03 | `S2_01_C03_ResolvedDigestAndBuildId_FlowIntoSubmitAndWatch_InOrderOnceEach` | gRPC sequence capture |\n| C04 | `S2_01_C04_ResolveUnavailable_NoSubmitNoWatch_FailedWithDiagnostic`, `…CliReportsPreWatchUnknown_WithoutRetry` | transport error fixture |\n| C05 | `S2_01_C05_SubmitResponseLost_NoWatch_NoBuildIdInvented`, `…CliKeepsRemoteStateUnknown` | transport fault fixture |\n| C06 | class summary + `FakeBuildService` comment: the fake does not parse raw_spec, does not enforce DisallowUnknownFields or full pins, does not dedup on the server side, and does not check registry existence. Live integration (`GrpcToolSpecClientIntegrationTests`) is not run here and is out of scope. | source/evidence review |\n\nStaged seam tests: the caller request ID becomes the Submit request ID and appears on `JobCreated`; the store sees the full basis before any Submit (Submit count 0 at store time); a store failure means Submit and Watch are 0; a store cancellation propagates; the default overload sends a fresh GUID each time; a blank request ID is rejected before any RPC; a legacy-only implementer delegates on default options and throws `NotSupportedException` otherwise.\n\n### Verification (seoy, .NET 10.0.201, Release)\n- **Old-red:** the new tests on the unchanged base source fail to compile with 20 errors (CS0246 `ToolSpecBuildOptions` / `ToolSpecSubmitBasis`).\n- **Green:** full solution build had 0 warnings and 0 errors. `ToolSpecWireP05Tests` + `GrpcToolSpecClient*` + `SubmitCommandTests`: 132 total, 0 failed, 1 skipped (the live NodeVault integration test, which needs `NODEKIT_NODEVAULT_URL`).\n- **Mutations** (each build confirmed at 0 errors before the run):\n  - m1 sends a fresh GUID as the Submit request ID → 2/18 fail (CallerRequestId, BeforeSubmit basis).\n  - m2 swallows the store failure → 1/18 fails (BeforeSubmitFails).\n- Local `/tmp` tree and seoy tree hashes match (`e61f63d8`).\n- Format check, the strict `TreatWarningsAsErrors` build and the full suites: see the follow-up comment / CI.\n\n### Boundaries\n- This adds no journal or receipt storage. P04.store/integrate consumes this seam, and the order P05.wire → P04 → P05.reentry/result is unchanged.\n- #86: no `FailurePhase`/`GrpcStatusCode`/`FailureKind` and no server request_id lookup were added. A submit with no build_id stays unknown, and nothing resubmits automatically.\n- #74 (heartbeat/reconnect/replay) and #59 (real NodeVault submit) remain later integration work. The local fake passing is not evidence of a real server.\n- There is no new GUI feature; the GUI caller compiles unchanged.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/issues/117/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/issues/117/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"actor":{"login":"HeaInSeo","id":126678443,"node_id":"U_kgDOB4z1qw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126678443?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeaInSeo","html_url":"https://github.com/HeaInSeo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeaInSeo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeaInSeo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeaInSeo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeaInSeo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeaInSeo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeaInSeo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeaInSeo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeaInSeo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeaInSeo/received_events","type":"U