pos/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/deployments","created_at":"2026-04-06T11:35:30Z","updated_at":"2026-10-28T19:24:29Z","pushed_at":"2026-10-28T19:24:25Z","git_url":"git://github.com/HeaInSeo/NodeKit.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:HeaInSeo/NodeKit.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/HeaInSeo/NodeKit.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/HeaInSeo/NodeKit","homepage":null,"size":56437,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"language":"C#","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":0,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":9,"license":null,"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":9,"watchers":0,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":true,"maintain":true,"push":true,"triage":true,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/pulls/121","html_url":"https://github.com/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/pull/121","diff_url":"https://github.com/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/pull/121.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/pull/121.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-11T04:15:04Z"},"body":"## Summary\nP05.reentry slice2 — NodeKit v0.9.1 **S2-04** (user cancel + two-stage timeout) on top of the landed slice1 (S2-03, #120).\n\n- **Receipt `local_abort`** (optional, `nodekit.operation.v1`): `{reason, remote_build_state: \"unknown\", recorded_at}` with reason `user_cancel | connect_timeout | watch_timeout | transport_cancelled`. Allowed only before `terminal`; cleared when a terminal watch is observed (submit or `receipt watch`); validated on open (terminal + local_abort, non-`unknown` remote state or unknown reason → `OPERATION_RECORD_INVALID`, exit 2, RPC 0).\n- **submit**: on Ctrl-C / `--connect-timeout` / `--watch-timeout` the CLI first records `local_abort`, then (user cancel with a known build_id only) sends the best-effort `CancelToolBuild` on its own 5 s token. Phase/build_id/observation are never moved to a server result that was not observed.\n- **Wording**: connect-timeout no longer implies that no remote build exists (Submit may have reached the server; response lost). Human hints now give the request ID (no build_id) or `nodekit receipt watch <receipt>` (known build_id / watch-timeout).\n- `SubmitCommand.RunUntilUserCancel` — test-only user-cancel seam (same path as Ctrl-C).\n- Fake BuildService knobs: `HangOnSubmitToolBuild`, `HangOnCancelToolBuild` (token-cooperative), `WatchEventDelay`, `WatchFailure`.\n\n## S2-04 map (`SubmitCancelTimeoutP05Tests`)\n| ID | Test |\n|---|---|\n| C01 | `UserCancel_AfterBuildId_…` + `…CancelRpcStillReachesServerAfterUserTokenFired` — CancelToolBuild ×1 on build-fixture-001, exit 130, receipt acknowledged / no observation / local_abort user_cancel·unknown |\n| C02 | `UserCancel_BeforeBuildId_…` (Resolve hang → prepared) + `UserCancel_WhileSubmitInFlight_…` (Submit hang → submit_in_flight); CancelToolBuild 0 |\n| C03 | `UserCancel_CancelRpcHangs_…` (submit) + `ReceiptCancel_CancelRpcHangs_…` (receipt cancel, closes Guardrail P3-2): 4 s ≤ elapsed < 10 s, stderr warning, no server-cancel claim |\n| C04 | `ConnectTimeout_SubmitHangs_…` (JSONL CONNECT_TIMEOUT/uncertain, no build_id) + `ConnectTimeout_ResolveHangs_Human_…`; CancelToolBuild 0 |\n| C05 | `WatchTimeout_AfterBuildId_…` — exit 125, build_id/last event shown, CancelToolBuild 0, then `receipt watch` re-enters to terminal and clears local_abort |\n| C06 | `StagedTimers_…` — build_id before connect-timeout, watch outlives it (1.5 s), Succeeded before watch-timeout → exit 0; receipt bytes unchanged past the watch deadline |\n| P3-1 | `ReceiptWatch_RpcErrorMidStream_…` — watch Unavailable → exit 1, not recorded as Failed, receipt unchanged |\n| guard | `LocalAbort_InvalidRecord_IsRejectedOnOpen_NoRpc` ×3 |\n\n## Out of scope\nS2-05 JSONL/result contract (P05.result) — note: the JSONL `USER_CANCELLED` record still says `recovery: terminal`; not changed here. No `receipt replay`, `--build-id`, P07, or server/NodeVault change. In-process fake only; no live NodeVault (#74/#59).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/issues/121/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaInSeo/NodeKit/issues/121/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]